stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_load_relations: SELECT FROM member.member_team_relations
    q_load_relations --> q_join_members: JOIN member.members ON member_id = supabase_auth_user_id
    q_join_members --> q_join_teams: JOIN member.teams ON team_id = id
    q_join_teams --> q_check_uid: filter by discord_uid (optional)
    q_check_uid --> q_all_relations: no filter applied
    q_check_uid --> q_filtered: WHERE discord_uid = input_value
    q_all_relations --> [*]: return all member-team pairs ordered by generation, team
    q_filtered --> q_has_teams: member has team assignments
    q_filtered --> q_no_teams: LEFT JOIN yields NULL team
    q_has_teams --> [*]: return (discord_uid, supabase_auth_user_id, team_id, team_name, discord_role_id)
    q_no_teams --> [*]: return member row with NULL team fields

    note right of q_join_members
        INV-001: member_team_relations.member_id must reference existing member
        INV-002: member_team_relations.team_id must reference existing team
        INV-003: A member may belong to zero or more teams (LEFT JOIN)
    end note
